{
  "uid": "poc-evicted",
  "title": "3 · Evicted and disrupted pods",
  "description": "Why pods ended, and their last lines, even after the kubelet deleted the log files.",
  "tags": [
    "logging-poc"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "logging-poc"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "title": "Dashboards"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "type": 1,
          "label": "cluster",
          "stream": "",
          "refId": "cluster"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(cluster)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "type": 1,
          "label": "namespace",
          "stream": "{cluster=\"$cluster\", container=~\".+\"}",
          "refId": "namespace"
        },
        "definition": "label_values({cluster=\"$cluster\", container=~\".+\"}, namespace)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "pod",
        "label": "Pod contains",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| How a pod ends | What shows up here |\n|---|---|\n| **Kubelet eviction** (node short of memory or disk) | an `Evicted` event with the reason; the pod record says `reason=Evicted` |\n| **Eviction API** (drain, Karpenter, autoscaler) | no `Evicted` event; the pod record says `disruption=EvictionByEvictionAPI` |\n| **Preemption or taint** | `Preempted` or `TaintManagerEviction` events |\n| **Out of memory** | the container record says `OOMKilled`; the kernel line is on [4 · Node logs](/d/poc-nodes) |\n| **Crash loop** | `BackOff` events, one more after each restart |\n| **Force delete** | a `DELETED` pod record with no other reason |\n\nThe logs stay in Loki after the node deletes them: type the pod name in **Pod contains** to read its last lines below."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Kubelet evictions",
      "description": "Evicted events: the kubelet removed a pod because the node ran short of a resource.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", job=\"kubernetes-events\", reason=\"Evicted\", namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Eviction API",
      "description": "Pods removed through the Eviction API: drains, Karpenter, cluster autoscaler.",
